Subject: [PATCH 1/5] sr-aef: write aalt's lookups as rules

aalt may contain only single and alternate substitutions, so a font whose aalt
referenced lookups uncompiled to features that did not compile. Now aalt holds
the lookups' rules, and a lookup nothing else uses is dropped.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
